{"hw":"ἀντωμοσία","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀντωμοσία</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀντωμοσία</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">ἀντόμνυμι</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">oath</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">affidavit</b> made by the prosecutor, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19b</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">23.13</span> </span>; also, by the defendant, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Is.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.6</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Harp.</span> </span> s. v., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Poll.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.55</span> </span>.</div></div>"}